# Perfect Corp YouCam Virtual Try-On API
# 1. Register at https://yce.makeupar.com/api-console/en/api-playground/ai-clothes/
# 2. Create an API key (free trial includes 40 units)
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key, then restart the server.
#
# Without a key the app still works - the try-on page falls back to a
# side-by-side preview of your photo next to the garment.
YOUCAM_API_KEY=

# Optional. WebMCP origin-trial token for this deployment's origin, so the
# agent tools work on stable Chrome without chrome://flags. Register at
# https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials/#/register_trial/4163014905550602241
# Absent, document.modelContext is undefined and the storefront is unchanged.
WEBMCP_ORIGIN_TRIAL_TOKEN=
